  message: "Shipped. New go_memberlist_linker detects 12 canonical delegate methods (NotifyMsg/GetBroadcasts/LocalState/MergeRemoteState/NotifyJoin/NotifyLeave/NotifyUpdate/NotifyConflict/NotifyMerge/NotifyAlive/NotifyPingComplete/AckPayload), anchors on memberlist.Create() callers, falls back to first non-delegate function. 14 tests, 100% coverage. Acceptance validation (alertmanager 42 dead methods → reachable) deferred to next prospector run."  # 65d7
- op: discuss  # 9056
